<title>CANADA: Semi-Tech Corp eliminates dividend.</title>
<headline>Semi-Tech Corp eliminates dividend.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semi-Tech Corp said on Friday that it has eliminated its quarterly dividend in the wake of the company's recent financial results.</p>
<p>Semi-Tech said in a statement that the dividend change was effective immediately.</p>
<p>The consumer products company posted an C$17.6 million loss in the six months ended September 30, compared to a C$13.2 million profit in the same period last year.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
